# Netlify serves the site directly from the repo (Netlify-only stack).
# michaelrayberry.com (the typo domain) is added as a Netlify domain alias and
# redirected to the canonical host here — Netlify supports host-based rules.
https://michaelrayberry.com/*      https://michealrayberry.com/:splat  301!
https://www.michaelrayberry.com/*  https://michealrayberry.com/:splat  301!

